Dear all,

The "Fedora Packages of R Software" CRAN page has been updated
(thanks, Kurt!) to include answers to some questions raised here
during the last few months. Specifically, there is a new section about
containerized environments [1] detailing the usage of Fedora Docker
images and Toolbox environments. As always, suggestions and
improvements (either here or as a new issue in [2]) are welcome.

[1] https://cran.r-project.org/bin/linux/fedora/#containerized-environments
[2] https://pagure.io/R/fedora-r-packages

